; A placement the stack cannot hold: fold the sheet in half, then try to slide
; the quarter-fold's block over .b. The target flap runs uncut across the fold
; axis, so the block would have to enclose it — the layer-order invariant
; rejects it rather than emitting an impossible state.

paper square
fold map .b onto .a moving .b
.p = free on --ab from .a at 1/4
fold map .a onto .p moving .a over .b

; expect error "would pierce layer"
